00:58:16.020 --> 00:58:42.840
<v Ira Glass>This show first aired a year ago. The 76-year-old man that you heard at the beginning of the program did not get a yes from the woman that he flew across the country for. He has moved on. He says he has no regrets. He's glad he tried. Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks as always to our programs co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he got a new puppy, puts him to sleep every night with these words.
<v Ira Glass>这个节目一年前首次播出。你在节目开头听到的那位76岁的老人，并没有从他飞越全国去找的那位女性那里得到肯定的答复。他已经向前看了。他说他没有任何遗憾。他很高兴自己尝试过。我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《美国生活》由公共广播交易所PRX发送给公共广播电台。像往常一样感谢我们节目的联合创始人托瑞·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，他养了一只新小狗，每天晚上都会用这些话哄它睡觉。

00:58:42.840 --> 00:58:52.650
<v Shankar Vedantam>Good night, my sweet Darling. Let us drift away to paradise in our dreams and wake up together to a new and wonderful day. I kiss you gently and fall asleep in your arms.
<v Shankar Vedantam>晚安，我甜蜜的亲爱的。让我们在梦中漂向天堂，一起醒来迎接新的一天。我轻轻地吻你，在你的怀抱中睡去。

00:58:52.650 --> 00:58:57.650
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
